  "body": "Campbell 14th ed., Ch.3 Arthroplasty of the Hip [[p.178-323]]. Neeche sub-topics ko is order me padho.\n\n:::flow\n[teal] Basics | 1) Biomechanics and implant design ;; 2) Bearings, indications, templating, hip-spine\nv\n[amber] Surgery | 3) Approaches and implantation ;; 4) THA in specific disorders\nv\n[red] Problems | 5) Complications I (nerve, DVT, dislocation...) ;; 6) Complications II (fracture, infection) ;; 7) Loosening, osteolysis, ALTR\nv\nRevision | 8) Revision I (removal) ;; 9) Acetabular defects ;; 10) Femoral defects\nv\nRevision | 11) Post-op and cheat-sheet\n:::\n\n> [!tip] Last-minute revision ke liye seedha **Cheat-sheet** kholo.\n\n> [!flag] Hip resurfacing (Ch.4) aur hip arthrodesis (Ch.5) abhi nahi daale.\n"
